**Construction.** Parity-stripped trinity: `χ̃_P(n) := χ_P(n) − α_2·(−1)^n` where `α_2 = (1/N) Σ χ_P(n)(−1)^n`, plus cumulative `V_q^prim` strip across squarefree q ≤ Q. No external technique imported.

